&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:18pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;"&gt;(2) 複数事業主制度の掛金に占める当社グループの割合&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:27pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:456.5pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
